*> vybe-test: cobol/cobol2023_intrinsics/formatted_date_runtime
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_cobol2023_intrinsics.rs

IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
01 WS-DATE PIC X(10).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE FUNCTION FORMATTED-DATE("YYYY-MM-DD" 20240101) TO WS-DATE.
    DISPLAY WS-DATE.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-DATE DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "2024-01-01"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [2024-01-01] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

